# ΓöÇΓöÇ OpenBao seed values (deployed servers) ΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇΓöÇ
# Copy to `seed.env` on EACH server (gitignored). ONLY the `openbao` compose
# service reads this file; api/workers/agent containers never receive these
# values as environment variables ΓÇö they fetch them from OpenBao at startup
# (secretsSource "openbao" on /health/ready).
#
# Same values on both servers. DATABASE_URL / REDIS_URL / CORS etc. stay in
# `.env.production` (non-secrets) ΓÇö do NOT put them here.
#
# Values are seeded under the `recruithub` namespace; a `dev` namespace is
# created from the same values unless a DEV_<KEY> override is set below.
#
# Rotate: edit seed.env -> `docker compose up -d openbao` -> restart apps.
#
# Gmail OAuth: keep JSON on ONE line (no surrounding quotes).

OPENAI_API_KEY=
GROQ_API_KEY=
VAPI_API_KEY=
VAPI_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
LIVEKIT_API_KEY=
LIVEKIT_API_SECRET=
S3_ACCESS_KEY=
S3_SECRET_KEY=
GMAIL_CREDENTIALS_JSON=
GMAIL_TOKEN_JSON=
RESEND_API_KEY=
JWT_SECRET_KEY=
INTEGRATIONS_ENCRYPTION_KEY=
TALENTOS_BE_API_KEY=
INTERNAL_HEALTH_API_KEY=
AIC_API_KEY=
SEED_ADMIN_PASSWORD=
SEED_SUPERADMIN_PASSWORD=

# Optional per-key overrides for the `dev` namespace (local dev). Leave unset
# to mirror the deployed values.
# DEV_OPENAI_API_KEY=
# DEV_JWT_SECRET_KEY=
